reconstructing, or substantially reproducing Zap or a derivative or clone of
it. You may not direct or enable another person or service to do so for you.
This restriction applies to both commercial and noncommercial cloning, even
if the resulting work would use this same license.

AI assistance for understanding, testing, debugging, or maintaining a permitted
Zap fork is allowed, provided it is not used to create a separate clone or to
circumvent this license. No rights over unprotected ideas, general functionality,
or independently created materials are claimed by this provision.

